1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Seventeenth Episode
The Greedy Ghost

15
00:02:00,301 --> 00:02:03,577
This is a truly
terrible story.

16
00:02:04,021 --> 00:02:06,376
The deceased owner
of the house...

17
00:02:06,421 --> 00:02:08,776
...was very miserly,
despite being rich,

18
00:02:08,821 --> 00:02:11,210
and treated the poor terribly.

19
00:02:11,261 --> 00:02:15,300
And is it true what they say: that now
there is a ghost living in the house?

20
00:02:15,341 --> 00:02:19,334
That's right! It seems that it is
the owner herself...

21
00:02:19,381 --> 00:02:22,771
...who continues to haunt
the house as a ghost.

22
00:02:22,821 --> 00:02:26,018
- And do you believe it?
- Many people believe it.

23
00:02:26,061 --> 00:02:29,133
What?! Where do you want to go, Your Highness?
It's already dark outside!

24
00:02:34,821 --> 00:02:37,460
Besides, today's lesson
is not over yet!

25
00:02:37,501 --> 00:02:40,811
That means you will do it.
Make sure you study hard!

26
00:02:40,861 --> 00:02:43,694
Don't worry..
Hey, but I am the teacher!

27
00:02:43,741 --> 00:02:46,175
Then teach yourself! Goodbye!

28
00:02:46,221 --> 00:02:48,815
- Are you leaving? - I'm going to play
in the ghost's house.

29
00:02:48,861 --> 00:02:51,295
No! I forbid you
to leave the castle!

30
00:02:51,341 --> 00:02:54,174
Wait, Prince!
Don't go away!

31
00:03:02,821 --> 00:03:06,257
Stop him! Stop
Prince Sapphire, quick!

32
00:03:06,301 --> 00:03:08,656
He went to the ghost's house!

33
00:03:10,701 --> 00:03:12,612
Did you hear, Baron?

34
00:03:12,661 --> 00:03:15,016
It's the ghost's house
that everyone is talking about.

35
00:03:15,061 --> 00:03:17,416
That's the one!
Follow him immediately

36
00:03:17,461 --> 00:03:21,739
Yes, sir! Do I have to go
into that house too?

37
00:03:22,221 --> 00:03:24,894
Why not? You often asked
to borrow money...

38
00:03:24,941 --> 00:03:27,011
...from the owner,
before she died,

39
00:03:27,061 --> 00:03:29,495
so you are a client
of the ghost, let's say! Go!

40
00:03:58,381 --> 00:04:01,339
Damn, so much fog!
I can barely see anything anymore.

41
00:04:01,381 --> 00:04:03,212
I have to go slower

42
00:04:29,021 --> 00:04:31,012
It went out!

43
00:04:32,941 --> 00:04:35,011
What's wrong with you? Are you scared?

44
00:04:35,821 --> 00:04:37,891
Come on, don't be a scaredy-cat!

45
00:04:37,941 --> 00:04:41,820
Look at me: I am not afraid
at all, even if I am a girl! See?

46
00:04:47,741 --> 00:04:50,209
Did you get angry?
Good! Keep going!

47
00:05:05,781 --> 00:05:07,612
Go back home, Opal.

48
00:05:07,901 --> 00:05:11,860
I will spend a night here. Do
you think the ghost will hurt me?

49
00:05:13,501 --> 00:05:16,652
Tomorrow morning you will
come pick me up. Don't worry.

50
00:05:18,421 --> 00:05:21,015
Rest easy,
I don't need your help.

51
00:05:21,061 --> 00:05:23,291
Don't worry!
Go home, now.

52
00:05:23,501 --> 00:05:26,254
Bye, see you tomorrow!
Bye, Opal!

53
00:05:39,901 --> 00:05:43,098
Where are you going? Wait! Wait!

54
00:05:46,661 --> 00:05:49,255
You really are a terrible hat!

55
00:06:36,300 --> 00:06:39,054
It's impossible
to cross this swamp!

56
00:06:40,540 --> 00:06:42,736
Well, this way I have a good
excuse to get out of here.

57
00:06:42,780 --> 00:06:46,057
I must consider myself
lucky. Let's head right back!

58
00:06:48,140 --> 00:06:50,097
Help! I'm drowning!

59
00:06:51,500 --> 00:06:54,413
Damn! I didn't know it was
so shallow.

60
00:06:56,020 --> 00:06:58,012
But that is Opal!

61
00:06:59,300 --> 00:07:01,132
Wait!

62
00:07:04,020 --> 00:07:06,660
Hey, ghost! Show
yourself, if you're there!

63
00:07:21,020 --> 00:07:23,660
This is truly
a supernatural event!

64
00:07:25,420 --> 00:07:27,696
Damn, so many books!

65
00:07:44,660 --> 00:07:46,731
Oh, there's a set table!

66
00:07:47,620 --> 00:07:50,613
Now this is a surprise!
I'll taste this!

67
00:07:51,140 --> 00:07:53,814
It's strange, it seems to
me that the bottle is moving!

68
00:07:58,900 --> 00:08:00,812
I don't want to drink!

69
00:08:08,100 --> 00:08:10,012
This must be a trick!

70
00:08:15,300 --> 00:08:17,019
No! No! I don't want it!

71
00:08:17,060 --> 00:08:19,495
I'm sure it's made
of mud and clay!

72
00:08:26,420 --> 00:08:28,571
Well, it's good anyway.

73
00:08:31,060 --> 00:08:32,540
Good!

74
00:08:36,260 --> 00:08:39,298
Thank you! This is even
too much kindness!

75
00:08:40,900 --> 00:08:44,018
Strange, though..! How come
the ghost treats me so well?

76
00:08:44,060 --> 00:08:46,894
I saw your magic! Why
don't you show yourself?

77
00:08:47,141 --> 00:08:49,814
It must be the portrait of the
owner. What a beautiful woman!

78
00:08:54,581 --> 00:08:56,333
Who's there?

79
00:09:03,021 --> 00:09:07,014
- You're quite the flatterer!
- Are you the ghost?!

80
00:09:08,421 --> 00:09:12,175
- That's right, my handsome.
- You are older than the portrait.

81
00:09:12,261 --> 00:09:15,333
- Yes, I was much younger there.
- But I'm surprised.

82
00:09:15,381 --> 00:09:18,214
I thought ghosts
had a horrible appearance.

83
00:09:18,261 --> 00:09:21,139
Usually that's the case
and it could be my case,

84
00:09:21,181 --> 00:09:23,490
but I don't feel like looking
like an old witch...

85
00:09:23,541 --> 00:09:25,293
..and I take care of my appearance.

86
00:09:25,341 --> 00:09:27,332
Excuse me, but why
are you treating me so well?

87
00:09:27,381 --> 00:09:29,815
I heard that in life
you were very stingy.

88
00:09:29,941 --> 00:09:32,660
Yes, go ahead and say it.
What does it matter now, anyway?

89
00:09:32,701 --> 00:09:35,010
I was the stingiest and greediest in the world!

90
00:09:35,061 --> 00:09:38,019
And that is why
I cannot rest in peace!

91
00:09:40,221 --> 00:09:42,496
Not even after my death!

92
00:09:42,541 --> 00:09:45,499
And what's worse,
I cannot go to Heaven!

93
00:09:45,541 --> 00:09:47,816
Why don't you give yourself a push
and go up?

94
00:09:47,861 --> 00:09:49,772
You see, that's how you go to Heaven.

95
00:09:52,221 --> 00:09:54,212
You whistle, the car arrives.

96
00:09:54,261 --> 00:09:56,650
...and if you can go there,
it takes you on board.

97
00:09:56,701 --> 00:09:59,135
But I have never been picked up!

98
00:10:03,861 --> 00:10:06,170
Heaven is calling me.

99
00:10:07,741 --> 00:10:10,050
Then you can go up to Heaven!

100
00:10:11,021 --> 00:10:14,013
I'm afraid not.
The problem is not solved.

101
00:10:18,661 --> 00:10:20,811
What a strange light this is..

102
00:10:20,861 --> 00:10:23,421
Madam, I'll hold the light
for you, so you can climb up!

103
00:10:23,461 --> 00:10:26,021
- There, now climb!
- Thank you!

104
00:10:26,581 --> 00:10:28,253
It's slipping!

105
00:10:32,021 --> 00:10:34,330
Did you hurt yourself,
Prince Sapphire?

106
00:10:34,381 --> 00:10:37,498
Don't worry about me!
Climb as fast as you can!

107
00:10:53,901 --> 00:10:57,018
You were right, they don't
want to let you reach Heaven.

108
00:10:57,061 --> 00:10:59,177
It's too much for me!
I can't take it anymore!

109
00:10:59,221 --> 00:11:01,655
I am desperate
and I even want to die!

110
00:11:01,701 --> 00:11:04,010
The fact is that you cannot
die twice.

111
00:11:04,061 --> 00:11:06,575
Oh, right, I had forgotten!

112
00:11:06,821 --> 00:11:09,460
I wish I could help you,
but I don't know how.

113
00:11:11,101 --> 00:11:14,332
I found it! Tell me, were there many
people at your funeral?

114
00:11:14,381 --> 00:11:17,817
- I didn't have a funeral.
- That's exactly the point:

115
00:11:17,861 --> 00:11:21,570
the funeral! We will need
a large number of people...

116
00:11:21,621 --> 00:11:24,579
...to attend! How many
people were closest to you?

117
00:11:24,621 --> 00:11:26,532
Let me think.

118
00:11:29,301 --> 00:11:32,577
I had three dear friends,
whom I had known for many years.

119
00:11:34,021 --> 00:11:37,297
Maybe that will be enough! I'm going to fetch them!
Tell me where they live!

120
00:11:37,341 --> 00:11:39,332
But why do you think
that the funeral...

121
00:11:39,381 --> 00:11:41,417
...will allow me
to go to Heaven?

122
00:11:41,461 --> 00:11:44,612
Because everyone weeps for the deceased
during the funeral service.

123
00:11:44,661 --> 00:11:47,016
I think that anyone
can go to Heaven...

124
00:11:47,061 --> 00:11:49,017
.if people weep for him

125
00:11:49,221 --> 00:11:51,451
Yes, but I have been
too wicked!

126
00:11:51,501 --> 00:11:54,015
Oh, no! Forgive me!
I didn't mean that.

127
00:11:56,741 --> 00:11:58,732
Here are their addresses

128
00:11:58,781 --> 00:12:01,659
Here, this one here...
This one here and this other one here..!

129
00:12:01,701 --> 00:12:03,578
I will ask them to come!

130
00:12:22,221 --> 00:12:25,179
Drink this cordial
and do not be afraid of me.

131
00:12:25,221 --> 00:12:28,691
You will remember that I lent you
some money. Did you bring it?

132
00:12:29,421 --> 00:12:32,094
But... is she still talking about
money even though she's a ghost?!

133
00:12:32,141 --> 00:12:35,292
Even a ghost remembers
the money she lent.

134
00:12:35,341 --> 00:12:38,094
Oh, no! If I keep going like
this, I will never go to Heaven!

135
00:12:38,141 --> 00:12:40,450
Are you really sure that
you can go to Heaven...

136
00:12:40,501 --> 00:12:42,378
..if someone cries for you?

137
00:12:42,621 --> 00:12:45,499
You eavesdropped, didn't
you? How indiscreet you are!

138
00:12:45,541 --> 00:12:48,101
Listen, what would
you say if I cried for you?

139
00:12:50,021 --> 00:12:53,809
Young man, if you are really
so kind, then please do it!

140
00:12:53,861 --> 00:12:56,375
I am willing to
clear your debts.

141
00:12:57,501 --> 00:12:59,696
First, I need another favor.

142
00:12:59,741 --> 00:13:02,813
You don't want to borrow
more money from me again, I hope!

143
00:13:02,861 --> 00:13:05,295
No, ma'am.
It's about Sapphire.

144
00:13:05,341 --> 00:13:07,411
What does
Prince Sapphire have to do with it?

145
00:13:07,461 --> 00:13:10,692
I would like you to find proof
that the Prince is a girl.

146
00:13:18,021 --> 00:13:20,774
So, let's see...
This is the first one.

147
00:13:21,381 --> 00:13:26,091
Hey, you! Did you borrow
some money from Mrs. Shannerock?

148
00:13:26,781 --> 00:13:28,931
Damn, this is a stable!

149
00:13:30,021 --> 00:13:31,818
Good heavens, what a scare!

150
00:13:31,861 --> 00:13:34,614
- What happened, Sapphire?
- Choppy, where are you?

151
00:13:35,421 --> 00:13:37,457
I'm here! What are you doing?

152
00:13:37,741 --> 00:13:40,699
Do you know why I'm here?
I'm looking for three people who..

153
00:13:40,741 --> 00:13:44,017
...can weep for the death
of a certain old lady.

154
00:13:44,421 --> 00:13:46,651
I see,
then I can help you too

155
00:13:46,701 --> 00:13:49,169
- What do you want me to do?
- You go that way!

156
00:13:49,221 --> 00:13:50,813
Alright!

157
00:13:54,261 --> 00:13:57,890
Quick! We have to help a poor
old lady! Come with me!

158
00:14:00,821 --> 00:14:03,858
Have you ever borrowed money
from Mrs. Shannerock?

159
00:14:03,901 --> 00:14:06,495
I asked her for a penny, but I've
already returned it. Goodbye!

160
00:14:14,941 --> 00:14:17,819
Why did you wake me up, little one?
I was sleeping so well!

161
00:14:17,861 --> 00:14:20,694
- Mrs. Shannerock...
- She lent me a nickel...

162
00:14:20,741 --> 00:14:22,891
...and died before I
could return it to her.

163
00:14:22,941 --> 00:14:25,250
- Come with me! Right now!
- What a rush!

164
00:14:25,301 --> 00:14:28,498
If you cry for her, she
will cancel your debt!

165
00:14:28,541 --> 00:14:31,214
- Really?
- What do you want from me?!

166
00:14:31,261 --> 00:14:33,821
Put me down! Put me
down, I said! Come on!

167
00:14:34,101 --> 00:14:37,889
Please excuse him. Did
you know Mrs. Shannerock?

168
00:14:37,941 --> 00:14:41,172
Yes, I knew her, and her greed
always made me feel very sorry for her.

169
00:14:41,221 --> 00:14:44,213
Could you cry for her? Be kind!

170
00:14:44,261 --> 00:14:46,491
Come with me to cry for her!

171
00:14:49,821 --> 00:14:52,858
Very well!
I'll be happy to come.

172
00:14:52,901 --> 00:14:56,132
...to this sort of funeral
whenever you want, even right now!

173
00:14:56,181 --> 00:14:58,649
It's an excellent idea on your part!

174
00:15:01,541 --> 00:15:03,691
You could cry for her, then!

175
00:15:03,741 --> 00:15:07,177
Come to think of it, why should we
cry for that woman?

176
00:15:07,221 --> 00:15:10,657
It's impossible! When she was alive, she didn't
even give us a piece of bread!

177
00:15:10,701 --> 00:15:12,612
You mangy old man! You'll see!

178
00:15:15,901 --> 00:15:18,017
Now I'm full.
I'm going home.

179
00:15:18,821 --> 00:15:21,415
Can you cry a little for her,
before you go?

180
00:15:26,221 --> 00:15:28,655
Even if I force myself,
can't you see I can't do it?

181
00:15:29,061 --> 00:15:30,813
Hypocrite!

182
00:15:30,901 --> 00:15:33,574
I couldn't pay her back
some money she lent me,

183
00:15:33,621 --> 00:15:36,818
so she took my house, my
horse, and everything I had.

184
00:15:36,861 --> 00:15:39,295
It's impossible for me to cry for her!

185
00:15:46,781 --> 00:15:49,773
Good heavens! I'm afraid
that no one will want to cry for her.

186
00:15:49,821 --> 00:15:53,416
At least you, who were her maid,
will try to cry, right?

187
00:15:53,621 --> 00:15:56,294
No, I won't! She made me
work without paying me...

188
00:15:56,341 --> 00:15:58,491
...and she didn't give me enough
to eat.

189
00:15:58,741 --> 00:16:02,017
No wonder a person
like that is rejected by Heaven.

190
00:16:02,061 --> 00:16:04,017
She deserves
to stay on Earth!

191
00:16:10,341 --> 00:16:12,730
Mean! They are all mean!

192
00:16:12,781 --> 00:16:15,898
This is too much for me,
even if I am a ghost!

193
00:16:16,221 --> 00:16:20,180
I like money, it's true, but
what's wrong with loving money?

194
00:16:20,221 --> 00:16:23,418
- Oh, no! You too!
- It's a hopeless endeavor!

195
00:16:23,821 --> 00:16:26,016
Yes, maybe it's better if we leave

196
00:16:30,261 --> 00:16:34,300
No, Prince! Please, stay
with me! Don't go away!

197
00:16:46,581 --> 00:16:48,412
Why did you stop?

198
00:16:48,461 --> 00:16:52,010
- I can't leave her like this.
- Do you want to go back, Sapphire?

199
00:16:52,181 --> 00:16:54,012
What do you say, Opal?

200
00:16:56,421 --> 00:16:59,413
See? Even Opal
agrees with me.

201
00:16:59,901 --> 00:17:02,176
You can go back to the city
with Opal, Choppy.

202
00:17:02,221 --> 00:17:04,451
- Watch out for the ghost.
- Go, Opal!

203
00:17:04,501 --> 00:17:06,332
Goodbye, Sapphire!

204
00:17:08,701 --> 00:17:11,818
Alas! I am a lonely
and miserable ghost!

205
00:17:11,861 --> 00:17:13,817
I am willing
to cry for you,

206
00:17:13,861 --> 00:17:15,897
as long as you do me the favor
I asked of you some time ago.

207
00:17:15,941 --> 00:17:18,899
But how do I get proof
that the Prince is a girl?

208
00:17:18,941 --> 00:17:21,819
- Ah, there he is coming back!
- I expected it!

209
00:17:21,861 --> 00:17:24,011
I am counting on you!
I am hiding!

210
00:17:25,741 --> 00:17:28,301
Oh, Prince!
I am glad you have returned!

211
00:17:28,341 --> 00:17:30,696
I thank you
for your kindness

212
00:17:30,741 --> 00:17:33,016
Please, make yourself comfortable in my house.

213
00:17:33,061 --> 00:17:36,133
Come! Follow me, Prince. Please.

214
00:17:49,061 --> 00:17:50,858
But it is magnificent!

215
00:17:51,181 --> 00:17:53,820
Look inside this wardrobe,
Prince.

216
00:17:55,341 --> 00:17:57,935
I hope there are
some clothes that you like.

217
00:17:58,141 --> 00:18:00,132
But you must be joking!

218
00:18:00,181 --> 00:18:03,730
Those are all women's clothes!
I am a boy! Got it?

219
00:18:03,781 --> 00:18:05,533
And I am a ghost!

220
00:18:06,101 --> 00:18:09,457
So I know for sure whether
you are a girl or a boy.

221
00:18:09,901 --> 00:18:12,017
This is not elegant enough.

222
00:18:14,421 --> 00:18:16,491
This is too big.

223
00:18:17,901 --> 00:18:19,653
This seems right!

224
00:18:20,221 --> 00:18:23,611
- Please, stop!
- The mirror is at the end of the hall.

225
00:18:26,421 --> 00:18:28,013
And now...

226
00:18:43,021 --> 00:18:46,491
Welcome! I didn't expect to
see you here, Princess Sapphire!

227
00:18:46,581 --> 00:18:48,173
Princess?!

228
00:18:48,221 --> 00:18:50,815
For a Princess who
pretends to be a Prince...

229
00:18:50,861 --> 00:18:54,570
...there is the death penalty in this kingdom!
- What? The death penalty?!

230
00:18:55,541 --> 00:18:59,420
Which do you prefer?
Decapitation or hanging?

231
00:18:59,461 --> 00:19:02,419
You cannot send
such a good person to death!

232
00:19:02,461 --> 00:19:04,372
But this is decreed
by the law of Silverland,

233
00:19:04,421 --> 00:19:06,412
against which
nothing can be done!

234
00:19:06,461 --> 00:19:09,419
Are you ready, Princess?
I will take you to Grand Duke Geralamon!

235
00:19:13,341 --> 00:19:16,094
I don't care at all
about this damn law!

236
00:19:16,141 --> 00:19:19,372
I don't find it reasonable to send
such a good person to death!

237
00:19:19,421 --> 00:19:23,096
I'm sorry, Prince Sapphire!
This man is very wicked.

238
00:19:23,141 --> 00:19:26,736
He took advantage of my good
faith for his dirty schemes.

239
00:19:26,781 --> 00:19:29,170
It seems my big mouth
woke him up.

240
00:19:31,101 --> 00:19:33,456
I wonder what I bumped into!

241
00:19:33,661 --> 00:19:35,891
Shall we go then, Princess?

242
00:19:35,941 --> 00:19:38,933
- Princess? And where is she?
- What?!

243
00:19:40,541 --> 00:19:44,295
I know you are a girl! I made
sure of it with my own eyes!

244
00:19:44,341 --> 00:19:47,936
Oh, is that so? Then why don't you
make sure of it once more?

245
00:19:47,981 --> 00:19:50,017
She must have changed...

246
00:19:50,421 --> 00:19:53,731
Madam, you saw it too
that she is a girl! Didn't you?

247
00:19:53,781 --> 00:19:55,612
- No!
- Did you hear?

248
00:19:55,661 --> 00:19:57,458
Even this lady says... What?!

249
00:19:57,501 --> 00:20:00,698
No! I assure you that Prince
Sapphire is without a doubt a boy!

250
00:20:00,741 --> 00:20:03,209
But it's impossible!
Look at the clothes in the wardro..

251
00:20:04,661 --> 00:20:07,221
Oh, no!
He was looking at himself in the mirr..

252
00:20:13,341 --> 00:20:16,856
Damned old hag! You'll
pay for your betrayal!

253
00:20:17,021 --> 00:20:19,330
I will forbid everyone
from coming to this house!

254
00:20:19,381 --> 00:20:22,418
Do you know what that means? That
no one will come to weep for you,

255
00:20:22,461 --> 00:20:24,736
so you will remain a ghost forever!

256
00:20:25,381 --> 00:20:29,010
- No! Neelon!
- So, what is Sapphire?

257
00:20:32,821 --> 00:20:35,096
Prince Sapphire is..

258
00:20:36,181 --> 00:20:39,378
...it's... it's... it's...
it's really a boy!

259
00:20:40,621 --> 00:20:42,452
You'll pay for this!

260
00:20:44,661 --> 00:20:47,175
Why did you do it? It
was a good opportunity!

261
00:20:47,221 --> 00:20:49,689
I don't know, Prince.
Really, I don't know!

262
00:20:50,621 --> 00:20:52,896
Look! It's that light again!

263
00:20:52,941 --> 00:20:55,136
It's the road to Heaven,
ma'am!

264
00:20:59,101 --> 00:21:01,740
I'll try to climb up.
Thank you, Prince!

265
00:21:04,941 --> 00:21:06,932
Watch out, ma'am!

266
00:21:08,181 --> 00:21:11,139
Help! Someone help me!

267
00:21:13,021 --> 00:21:16,058
I'm sorry that this time,
too, you didn't make it.

268
00:21:16,141 --> 00:21:18,609
Prince, I hate Heaven!

269
00:21:18,661 --> 00:21:21,892
Why is the other world
divided into Hell and Heaven?

270
00:21:23,661 --> 00:21:25,617
What is this noise?

271
00:21:29,061 --> 00:21:31,894
There he is! That is a
ghost! Set fire to the room!

272
00:21:31,941 --> 00:21:33,897
- Let everything burn!
- Yes, sir!

273
00:21:33,941 --> 00:21:36,694
Do you want to set the
house on fire?! I won't let you!

274
00:21:37,901 --> 00:21:41,780
Damn Shannerock!
Soldiers, keep setting the fire!

275
00:21:41,821 --> 00:21:43,413
Yes, sir!

276
00:21:44,901 --> 00:21:46,619
Help!

277
00:21:49,141 --> 00:21:51,336
Do you see? Evil
will strike your men...

278
00:21:51,381 --> 00:21:53,497
...if they continue to
set fire to the house!

279
00:21:53,541 --> 00:21:55,896
Don't listen to her!
Keep burning it!

280
00:21:56,621 --> 00:21:59,419
Stop, Neelon! This is
an order from the Prince!

281
00:21:59,661 --> 00:22:02,573
No, you are not a Prince! Your
Highness, you have given yourself away!

282
00:22:02,621 --> 00:22:05,818
You are a girl! Quick,
arrest Princess Sapphire!

283
00:22:07,101 --> 00:22:10,616
Alright, then I will stop them!
You, madam, put out the fire!

284
00:22:22,821 --> 00:22:24,698
Be careful, madam!

285
00:22:25,781 --> 00:22:27,612
It's over for this house!

286
00:22:28,101 --> 00:22:31,138
Shannerock will end up
being a ghost without a home!

287
00:22:31,421 --> 00:22:32,900
Without a home!

288
00:22:33,261 --> 00:22:36,571
Get out of here! It's
dangerous to stay here!

289
00:22:39,621 --> 00:22:42,260
Here I am! Let's get out
of here quickly! Let's go!

290
00:22:42,301 --> 00:22:46,294
This is my home, Prince.
I am too tired to move.

291
00:22:47,421 --> 00:22:49,218
Watch out!

292
00:22:50,021 --> 00:22:52,615
Please, get out
of here! I will stay.

293
00:22:52,661 --> 00:22:56,210
I am sorry to have disturbed you, but
by now I have given up on everything.

294
00:22:56,261 --> 00:22:58,616
- Even on going to Heaven?
- Yes.

295
00:22:58,661 --> 00:23:02,017
But now get out of here quickly! In
a little while this house will collapse.

296
00:23:02,061 --> 00:23:05,258
Be careful! Neelon
is trying to kill you!

297
00:23:05,501 --> 00:23:09,016
You worry about me...
at a moment like this?

298
00:23:09,061 --> 00:23:11,814
Prince Sapphire, I
beg you! Be careful!

299
00:23:11,861 --> 00:23:15,820
How sweet of you to worry so
much about me! I am so moved by it...!

300
00:23:21,421 --> 00:23:24,493
Good heavens! The fire has
stopped burning! How is that?

301
00:23:24,741 --> 00:23:28,529
Prince Sapphire, now
I can go to Heaven,

302
00:23:28,581 --> 00:23:31,175
since you have shed
tears for me.

303
00:23:31,261 --> 00:23:35,254
Please, leave this house now
that the fire is not burning!

304
00:23:35,301 --> 00:23:36,893
Hurry!

305
00:23:44,381 --> 00:23:46,372
- The Prince's ghost!
- Neelon!

306
00:23:46,581 --> 00:23:49,141
Prince, I am overjoyed
that you were saved!

307
00:23:49,181 --> 00:23:52,378
Anyway, excuse me, what
happened to the ghost of Shannerock?

308
00:23:56,061 --> 00:23:59,451
Look! Mrs. Shannerock
is going up to Heaven!

309
00:24:04,581 --> 00:24:06,617
Goodbye, ma'am!

310
